window.products.push({"id":833021,"name":"Tagree 13x13 Black Square Jute Placemats Set of 4, Square Placemats, Farmhouse Placemats, Square Woven Placemats, Square Placemats Set of 4, Plate Cha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o9M4fqxEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY MATERIAL: Our black woven placemats are crafted with utmost precision and care of Vietnamese craftsmen in traditional village, using quality water hyacinth materials. The tightly woven design ensures durability and longevity, allowing you to enjoy these placemats for years to come. PROTECT YOUR TABLE: Our farmhouse placemats not only elevate the aesthetics of your dining table but also provide practical protection. Keep your table surface safe and free from scratches or heat damage with these reliable rustic placemats. MULTIPURPOSE AND FUNCTIONAL: Our straw placemats set 4 offer versatility beyond the dining table. Use them as decorative accents or table centerpieces to create a stylish and cohesive look for special occasions or everyday decor. Their compact size also makes them ideal for outdoor dining, picnics, or patio gatherings. DIMENSION: The placemat has the size 13”x13”, set of 4. The placemats color is dark brown, not fully black. Kindly note since this is handmade product so the size will be vary from 1-2 cm. EASY TO CLEAN AND MAINTAIN: Simply wipe with damp cloth, then store the wicker place mats in dry area to avoid mold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o9M4fqxEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAGREE","source_asin":"B09MCVVT6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MCVVT6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MCVVT6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":833022,"name":"Gorilla Grip Heat and Slip Resistant Silicone Spoon Rest, Patent Pending, Long Drip Pad, Fit Multiple Utensils, Ladles, Prevent Countertop Mess, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YfheHIXXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"No More Messy Counters: this ultra durable utensil rest will help alleviate countertop mess while you cook; features an extra long drip pad that will contain even long utensils and their messes; plus, ultra deep grooves and thick edges keep spills from overflowing onto countertops; finally, you can make cooking a no hassle experience Heat Resistant, Food Grade Silicone: constructed from extra durable, food grade silicone, the utensil rest is a great option for any home; non porous to resist stains and odors; flexible material won’t break like porcelain rests will; heat resistant to high temperatures so you’ll never have to worry about burning Grips Countertops: slip resistant silicone stays firmly in place on countertops, even with a variety of utensils, so that you can worry less about slipping and sliding while you cook Oversized 3 Slot Design: spoon rests are a thing of the past; this universal utensil rest can fit nearly any utensil, from ladles, to spatulas, wooden spoons, brushes, large forks and more; flexible slots make room for even extra thick handles; rest measures 5.5 by 5.5 inches Dishwasher Safe: unlike so many other utensil rests, this is dishwasher safe for the easiest cleaning experience ever","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YfheHIXXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gorilla Grip","source_asin":"B08LDZFHQB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LDZFHQB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LDZFHQB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
