window.products.push({"id":833035,"name":"Silicone Mats for Kitchen Counter, Heat Resistant Mats for Countertop Protector, Waterproof, Washable, Non Slip, Multipurpose, Microwave, Cooking XL L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pyzkLV+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The dishwasher safe countertop protector mat is safe, sturdy, 100% BPA free food-grade silicone, non-slip and heat resistant material to meet your all demands and can be applied to all corners of the home. This extra large mat is 1mm thicker than other mats & enough to absorb impact from fragile dishes or cookware. The heat resistance is between -40°F to 482°F and can be placed under the microwave, air fryer, induction stove, toaster oven, coffee maker and protect your ceramic tile, marble and expensive quartzite countertops from heat, scratches, grease & oil stains etc. This silicone counter mat will also increase the friction, ensure the cutting boards, appliances and cutlery stay in place. Our multipurpose silicone counter mats are widely used for home, kitchen, office, classroom, outdoor, baby, pet and any occasion. Its waterproof and oil proof surface saves you a lot of trouble, just use a cleaning cloth to wipe and clean easily. Whether you want to put it on a kitchen countertop, cabinet or any other small space, this silicone heat resistant mat is a suitable choice because it can be cut into different sizes and shapes and make mats for different places. It definitely suit your needs. It rolls up for easy storage when not in use and portable and good for outdoor activities. Silicone placemats will not occupy the space of your home at all. Mat colors are graceful and practical gift for housewarming. It is odorless, food can be placed directly. Safe for toddlers and pets. Also just put a silicone pad on and the bad dining table will instantly be clean. Great surface protector, placemat for kids activities. It is also provides your kids plenty of room to play with clay, paint, glue, crafting. Stay tidy and do cleaning in a beautiful mood. No more mess for moms to handle and you can enjoy every happy meal. Other Tips: We suggest not place this silicone mat in the oven. Do not directly expose the product to open flames or heat sources beyond limits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41pyzkLV+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BMN5JN4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMN5JN4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMN5JN4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
