window.products.push({"id":833062,"name":"Kitsure Kitchen Mats for Cushioned Anti-Fatigue Use 2 PCS, 0.47 Inches Thick Anti-Slip Kitchen Rugs,Easy-to-Clean and Comfortable Standing Desk Mats F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GnK15KA6L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DURABLE & EASY TO CLEAN】 The kitchen mats with anti-fatigue designs are made of premium PVC, which is waterproof, oilproof, and stain-resistant. The durable material also provides these anti-fatigue kitchen mats with longevity against deformation. Besides, the smooth surface enables you to clean the runner rugs for kitchen floor easily. You can just wipe off the stains with a damp cloth, or clean up the debris with a handheld vacuum. 【ANTI-CURLING & NON-SLIP】 Kitsure kitchen floor mat for standing desk can prevent tumbling with their anti-curling beveled edges, providing great protection for kids and pets. Moreover, the upgraded non-slip backing reduces the risk of sliding, making the kitchen rugs and mats suitable for various surfaces, such as planks, ceramics, laminate, marble, and concrete. (Note: Please place the kitchen rugs on DRY FLAT SURFACES, otherwise the wet floor may lead to unexpected falling.) 【UNIVERSAL & HIGH-QUALITY】 These two kitchen floor mats for in front of sink measure 17.3''(W) x 30''(L) and 17.3''(W) x 47''(L) separately, both sharing a thickness of 0.4 inches. The universal sizes enable them to be applied in most kinds of kitchens. You can place the two rugs anywhere freely according to the size of your kitchen. Moreover, with the upgraded material, these non-slip kitchen rugs and mats will not bring any pungent odors when in use. 【ANTI-FATIGUE & COMFORTABLE】 The Kitsure kitchen rugs of 0.47-inch employ ergonomics, which can efficiently relieve fatigue and improve blood circulation. Besides, the kitchen floor mats for floor are great supports and buffers between your feet and the hard ground when you need to stand long in any working area. Moreover, these kitchen floor mats with thick memory foam can protect fragile kitchenware such as bowls and dishes from breaking when falling on the mat. 【STYLISH & MULTIPURPOSE】 Kitsure kitchen floor mats feature exquisite empaistic workmanship, fashionable square patterns, and neutral tones. They can easily match any decor in different houses and kitchens. The versatile non-slip kitchen rugs are suitable for both indoor and outdoor areas. They can not only be used as anti-fatigue mats in the kitchens, laundries, offices, farmhouses, or other working places, but also yoga mats for exercising, meeting your wide range of applications.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GnK15KA6L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitsure","source_asin":"B09CTQN1SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTQN1SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTQN1SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
