window.products.push({"id":833220,"name":"SARA FRIENDS Nail Art Stamping Kit with Transparent Silicone Stamper and Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41j-e6ZfddL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"❤️ 【Optimized for Nail Stamping】 This product was developed to make nail stamping easy and reliable. ❤️ 【Perfect Match with Dedicated KKU-UK Gel】 SARA FRIENDS KKU-UK Gel pairs perfectly with this item. Check out our bundle deals, available at discounted prices. ❤️ 【Use for Patterns and French Nails】 You can easily create French nail art and patterned nail art using nail stamping. Check out the video we've made for guidance. ❤️ 【Cleaning Method】 Wipe with alcohol or use a stamper pattern removal tool (lint roller). Never use acetone. ❤️ 【How to Use】 Step 1. Apply base gel - cure - apply color gel - cure. (color gel can be skipped) / Step 2. Apply KKU-UK GEL on the desired art plate using a brush and then scrape off in one direction. / Step 3. Press the stamper onto the art pattern to pick up the KKU-UK GEL. / Step 4. Stamp the pattern onto the nail - cure - apply top gel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41j-e6ZfddL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SARA FRIENDS","source_asin":"B0BV69HZ1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV69HZ1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV69HZ1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
