window.products.push({"id":833327,"name":"Modus Furniture Element Chest, Chocolate Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1137.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71THjz3nyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Element Chest in Chocolate Brown is constructed from tropical solid mahogany and mahogany veneers. Carved drawer pulls run the length of each drawer for easy operation. Full extension ball bearing drawer glides open deep drawers. Sanded and stained solid wood drawer boxes feature English dovetail joinery. Dark chocolate brown finish displays tones ranging from dark brown to golden brown and burgundy. Chest consists of 5 spacious drawers. The entire Element bedroom collection provides structure. Thick mitre-jointed outer posts are the focus as the furniture effortlessly evolves following clean lines from the top panels all the way to the floor. Tropical solid mahogany and Mahogany veneers are finished in a dark chocolate. A high picture-framed headboard panel showcases geometric square insets with wood bed rails and footboard. The low profile footboard pushes outward with a mitre-jointed frame that carries the design of the matching dresser to the bed feet. The highest quality metal to metal hardware is used in the bed construction and a platform bed slat system renders box springs optional. Carved drawer pulls run the length of each drawer to ensure easy operation without the visual distraction of hardware. Each drawer features full extension drawer glides on sanded and stained solid wood drawer boxes with front/rear English dovetail joinery. The nightstands feature deep drawers and a 3-outlet power strip in the top drawer. The dresser includes a felt-lined top drawer. The large beveled glass mirror is framed in a rich finish of chocolate brown, a medium dark hue with highlights and reaches high to finish this set. The Element Collection is ready to define your bedroom, offering ample storage and a contemporary package. Package includes 1 Element Chest in Chocolate Brown. No assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71THjz3nyOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B074NGD3H2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074NGD3H2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074NGD3H2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":833328,"name":"EIYOBYF Large Door Draft Stopper - Adjustable Door Stoppers for Bottom of Doors 30\" to 38\" - Thicker 2\" Foam Strip Door Sweep Soundproof for Interior ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TdWz7NdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RECYCLED FABRIC: Our 600D oxford fabric is made by recycled plastic bottles. Saving energy is the purpose of our team in making door blocking strips. Oxford waterproof fabric make door draft blocker having better performance on waterproof and snowproof, easy to clean. LARGE FOAM: Under door draft stopper foam is 2 inches in diameter, which will not move with the opening of the door. HOOK AND LOOP FIXATION: The oxford fabric cover and door features sturdy hook and loop fasteners. Double protection from moving with the opening and closing of the door. BLOCKS MORE DRAFTS AND NOISE: Under door draft stopper sponge is 2\" thick, which will not move with the opening of the door. Blocking more drafts, sounds, lights, smoke, and odors, making the indoor more comfortable. WORKS ON ANY FLOOR SURFACE: Our door noise blocker made of oxford fabric, smooth surface can reduce friction with the ground. Door stopper glides easily on wood, carpet, tile, vinyl, and marble. WEAR AND TEAR RESISTANT: 600D oxford fabric is more sturdy and durable compared to other fabric types that are used for door sweep. Door draft blocker can withstand the continuous opening and closing of the door without tearing and wear. ENERGY SAVING THROUGHOUT THE YEAR: Our door seal stops hot and cold air from escaping, thus saving energy. Save you more energy costs. Save energy, let's act together！ MACHINE WASHABLE: When the door draft stopper is disassembled, the door will not be damaged, and it can be washed and used repeatedly. Remove the memory foam tubes and toss the cover into the washing machine then low temperature tumble dry. THREE MONTHS REPLACEMENT POLICY: At EIYOBYF we concerned your purchase experience and dedicated to your complete satisfaction. Pledging to replace your door draft stopper should anything ever go wrong. EASY TO INSTALL & ADJUST: Our door draft blocker is compatible with doors 30\" to 38\" wide, and seals gaps from 0.1\" to 1.5\" high. Please note that before purchasing, measure the gap and width of the door and keep the door clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TdWz7NdpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EIYOBYF","source_asin":"B09NMJL592","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NMJL592","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NMJL592","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
