window.products.push({"id":833345,"name":"Black Vulture Design Succulent Pillow - Cute Pillows - Nature Cactus Décor - Upgraded with Luxury Fabric in Authentic Color Shades – XL Handcrafted Gr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812gv7u6CdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE AND REALISTIC GREEN DECOR - The only succulent plant pillow custom dyed to match true to life succulent variety colors. Blue Bird = Echeveria 'Blue Bird', Greengage = Echeveria “Setosa”, Pale-Gray Lavender = Graptopetalum ‘Superbum’. UPGRADED WITH LUXURY FABRIC - Crafted from a higher-grade fabric then our competitors ensuring a higher quality and more comfortable and cute pillow! Made with Extra Soft and Fuzzy short pile Luxury Fabric. Packed with high quality PP Cotton that is soft, extra squishy, breathable, and can resist shrinkage. LARGEST SUCCULENT PLANT PILLOW ON THE MARKET - Measuring in at 21.25” Wide x 21.25” Long x 10” High!! Because if their extra-large size, these aesthetic pillows are bound to catch the eye and make for perfect cute bedroom décor! PERFECT GIFT - Black Vulture Design's Extra Large and cute throw pillows are sure to impress! A thoughtful and useful gift for your plant-loving friends, family, or significant other. Perfect present for the gardener, succulent lover, housewarming, birthday or anniversary. The recipient will love their new succulent décor and aesthetic throw pillows! WE CARE FOR THE PLANET - To honor our pledge to help make a positive change to our environment, we have partnered with OneTreePlanted. Every month that our product sells, we will be planting 25 trees! This small act will help in offsetting our CO2 emissions and give back care to Mother Nature. We are currently focusing our plantings on the Reforestation of Western North America, the region hit hardest by recent wild fires. COMPACT PACKAGING - All Black Vulture Design products are packaged with sustainability and efficiency in mind. That is why our pillows will come vacuum sealed and wrapped in a compact shape so as to reduce material waste, excess air in packaging and our carbon footprint by more efficient shipping practices. Please allow a few hours for our luxury pillows to fluff back up to their full size and you may use your hands to help fluff them up quickly!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812gv7u6CdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Black Vulture Design","source_asin":"B09RGP67PB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RGP67PB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RGP67PB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
