window.products.push({"id":833367,"name":"Amalfi 20 Piece Flatware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BEo0-6nuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ricci Silversmiths 20-Piece \"Amalfi\" Flatware Service Designer About Ricci Argentieri: Since 1840, Ricci Argentieri (also known as Ricci Silversmiths) has been—and continues to be—one of the most respected and renowned silversmiths in all of Europe, dedicated to producing sterling silver, silver plate, gold plate, and stainless collections with exceptional quality and beauty. To ensure that the tradition of quality craftsmanship continues, Ricci artisans apprentice under expert master craftsmen who have generations of experience, and all the artisans are trained to pay particularly attention to detail as well as to create pieces that combine tradition and contemporary styling flawlessly. Each piece of sterling silver is handcrafted at the factory in Padova, Italy—filed, polished and buffed by hand just as the original Ricci artisans did it in 1840. The silver plate and gold plate patterns, as well as the 18/10 stainless steel collections, are equally carefully crafted in multiple specialty factories throughout the Far East. Every Ricci pattern extends to the end of the piece and on both sides, front and back, and those pieces that are machine made are crafted on ultra-modern machinery that specializes in intricate designs. Materials, too, are of the highest quality: gold plate patterns are made using 18-kt. gold, and the stainless patterns are crafted using the highest quality 18/10 composition, creating stainless that is both lustrous and heavyweight. The knives are forged, carbon steel, and in most cases have two-piece hollow handles. Finally, before leaving the factory, every shipment of Ricci flatware—whether in sterling, silver plate, gold plate, or stainless—undergoes a comprehensive and stringent inspection that includes everything from the weight and balance of the piece to the shape of the spoon bowls, the quality of the polishing, and more. Color: SILVER.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BEo0-6nuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nina Ricci","source_asin":"B0057U0QFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0057U0QFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0057U0QFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":833368,"name":"Windy City Novelties - LED Light Up Mardi Gras Velvet Jester Party Hat | Mardi Gras Party Costume Supplies Raves, EDM Concerts Mardi Gras Party Hats","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bGGpNLDyL._AC_.jpg","description":"LAUGHTER IS THE BEST MEDICINE | Our world has become too serious. It seems like no one dares to chill out. You cannot change the world, but you can make it more fun by wearing our LED Light Up Mardi Gras Velvet Jester Party Hat. It's got a classic green-yellow-purple design, with “bells” on the tips of the tail containing bright red LEDs. Great for New Orleans, the Carnival Of Brazil, or any Mardi Gras near you. AN ANCIENT HISTORY LAUGHTER | Court Jesters started in Ancient Egypt. They’d put on a jester costume, complete with a distinctive jester hat, and entertain bored and depressed Pharaohs. Ancient Egypt is part of the dustbins history--but jester hats are still going strong! Our novelty hat will empower you to bring smiles to everyone you meet. You don’t even need to know any witty jokes. Fits most. MARDI GRAS MAGNIFIED | Mardi Gras is a big business. That’s great, except people tend to wear similar stuff. It’s like they all went to the same Mardi Gras novelty store. Our unique LED jester hat will let you stand out from the crowd. So when Fat Tuesday rolls in, add our funny hat to your Mardi Gras party accessories. Also perfect as a Halloween costume accessory. BASED IN THE USA | We’re proud to be a US based, family owned company that’s been in business since 1983. Our passion is to always provide you with the best selection of unique gifts and novelties on the market. INCLUDED: (1) LED Light Up Mardi Gras Velvet Jester Party Hat. AG-13 batteries included and installed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bGGpNLDyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Windy City Novelties","source_asin":"B002C1638S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002C1638S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002C1638S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
