window.products.push({"id":833572,"name":"Digital Instant Read Cooking Meat Thermometer - Collapsible Pocket Thermometer with Magnetic Back, Long Probe Grilling Thermometer w/LCD Screen - for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xgrx1tqOL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"High Performance - the Olewaha elegant and versatile meat thermometer is the best gold standard performing thermometer in its price range. In as little as 4 seconds you can get a quick and accurate internal temperature measurement for whatever it is you are preparing: from liquids like oil, milk and water to candy, pizza, steaks and even a whole animal. Easy to use and Easy Taken -With an easy to read electronic large and blue- backlight LCD display, it also has an auto shut off to save on your battery life and Hold temperature function. The best digital food thermometer comes with a strong magnet on the back of thermometer, stick it to fridge or oven door and iron material without flip and move. Also it has a hang hole, and you can find a suitable place to hang. Cook your food perfectly every time without the worry of overcooking or even worse illness from undercooking. Satisfaction Guaranteed - The Olewaha thermometer is covered by our 100% Lifetime Money-Back Guarantee so you can order with confidence. Specifications Response Time : 2-4 seconds to ±1~3℃ of final temperature in moving boiling water.  Accuracy: ±1°Cat -20~200°Cand±2°Cat other range.  Range : -50~300℃（-58~572℉）Do not submerse the cooking thermometer into the water for it isn’t waterproof.  Battery: 1x CR2032 battery (included) When the screen is blurred, please replace with a new battery.  Auto-Off : 10 min. For your safety, please fold away the sharp-tapered probe when not in use.  °F/°C Configurable: Fahrenheit is defaulted. The switch is in the inside where the battery placed.  Storage: large hanger and magnetic refrigerator attachment. Do not leave thermometer in oven while cooking. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button above to get your brand new Thermometer now and start enjoying more stress free, healthy meals!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xgrx1tqOL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Olewaha","source_asin":"B07MD2LL75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MD2LL75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MD2LL75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
