window.products.push({"id":833607,"name":"QEES Garment Bags for Suits, Garment Bag Dress Bags for Storage Dust Proof Suit Cover Bag for Suit, Coats, Jackets, Dress Closet Storage, Set of 3(23.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619kyiXY7ZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"❤️GARMENT BAGS FOR HANGING CLOTHES DESIGN: Our garmet bag has two sizes, Small Size 23.6×39 inch, it’s ideal for your dance costume, dress, suits, jackets, shirts, and other size clothes, suitable for 1-3 sets. ❤️DRESS BAG DURABLE PEVA MATERIAL: The garment bag high quality PEVA, durable, dustproof, waterproof, anti-static, reusable and easy to clean. Easy to Fold to Save Space for Storage. ❤️ID CARD/TAG HOLDER DESIGN: Convenient and time saving. Large zipper pockets design - large enough for storage dance shoes, gloves, socks, hats, tights, hair accessories and all of the accessories. ❤️CLASSICAL & PRACTICAL DESIGN: Ideal choice to store/display your clothing, everything is nice and wrinkle free, Transparent design - let you figure out what inside without open the suit bags. ❤️CLOTHES BAGS FOR TRAVEL Value Package Meal: 3 Garment Bags + 24 hours customer email service+ 100% satisfaction guarantee+ Fast Delivery. perfect for home daily use to protect suits, dresses, coats, shirts, leathers, skirts, jackets, trousers, uniforms, Ideal to put in wardrobe, storage or being carried while traveling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619kyiXY7ZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QEES","source_asin":"B07GZLW1GX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GZLW1GX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GZLW1GX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":833608,"name":"Glamerge Organic Cotton Reusable Produce Bags, for Vegetables, Fruits","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zYk2yGBGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Wish you had a sustainable food keeper for all your future trips to the grocery or farmer’s market? Before you grab a plastic bag for your weekly groceries, think long and hard about the consequences of disposable bags to your family and Mother Nature’s well-being. Recent studies show how 335 million metric tons of single-use plastic waste have made their way to landfills and our oceans. Only a small portion of these wastes are recycled. If this cycle continues, it won’t be long before we turn our planet into a plastic pandemonium. Store ingredients and non-food items in the reliable and planet-friendly Glamarge Organic Cotton Produce Bags! We recognize the rising demand for food storage without putting our planet in harm’s way. Our reusable and recyclable mesh bags make use of sustainable materials for a more durable and earth-friendly stasher you can use every day. These bags can store all kinds of fruits, vegetables, and ingredients needed for your healthy and sumptuous meals. Thanks to our cotton’s breathable properties, your leafy greens won’t sag or droop before they make their way to your kitchen. Our bags are equipped with durable drawstrings for added precaution when handling large and heavy fresh produce or root crops such as apples, peaches, cucumbers, and potatoes. The strings can be opened or closed effortlessly for time-saving convenience. Still not convinced? Check out these features to help you make a decision: ✅ Works great for storing small items such as cosmetics and keys✅ See-through mesh and color-coded tags allow you to organize the contents in the fridge✅ Set includes3 sizes: small, medium and large✅ Perfect for keeping light snacks during outdoor getaways✅ Ideal for storing bread Make sure you have enough produce bags for your next grocery run. Add Glamerge’s Organic Produce Bags to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zYk2yGBGL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glamerge","source_asin":"B081Y76195","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081Y76195","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081Y76195","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
