window.products.push({"id":833742,"name":"Drafting Chair, Tall Desk Chair Standing Desk Chair, Tall Office Chair for Standing Desk, Drafting Chair Adjustable Height with Foot Ring, Counter Hei","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwuV2cHWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🪑【Ergonomic Chair】The design of this drafting chair adopts the human body engineering principle, and the backrest and lumbar support fit snugly into the curve of your back. The wear-resistant mesh fabric keeps air circulation to avoid sweating and sticking. The tall office chair's widened seat(19.7'') is soft with high-density rebound foam, which is elastic even after long-time sitting. 🪑【90° Flip Up Armrest】A thickened, wider and breathable padding covers the flip-up arms of the tall computer chair, maximizing the comfort of the forearm and elbow. The 90° flip-up armrest computer chair saves us more space and avoids the bump between the desk and the tall desk chair, which enhances the lifespan of the mesh chair. Suitable for office, living room, study room, meeting room, etc. 🪑【Meeting Various Needs】The height of this standing desk chair can be adjusted from 23.4″to 29.7'' with the height adjustable footrest ring. It is for extra comfort when your feet can't reach the floor. Using the tension adjustment to switch from the working mode, under which the tall chair is fixed, to the rocking mode, as this high office chair can rock from 90 -125°to fit various sitting postures. Multiple adjustments help you find the most comfortable postures in this swivel chair. 🪑【Sturdy Construction】The durable metal bases and gas lifts complied BIFMA standard, as office drafting chairs is capable of 250 LBs and supports safe use in long term. 5 casters of this high desk chair, which can rotate for 360 degrees, enable quick and quiet movement without interrupting your work. Moreover, the casters will not damage the floor, making them very suitable for use in the office. 🪑【Save Time in Assembly】It takes 10-15 minutes to complete the installation of the tall adjustable office chair. The package comes with hardware and accessories inside, as well as the installation tool and manual. Our service team will also offer 24-hour support, so contact us via Amazon [Your Account]-[Your orders]-[Contact Seller].","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UwuV2cHWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JHK","source_asin":"B0BWPJW8SV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWPJW8SV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWPJW8SV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":833743,"name":"Disney Traditions by Jim Shore Sleeping Beauty \"Enchanted Kiss\" (4043627)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919d8ZrQxqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Slumbering peacefully in the top-most tower of King Stefan’s castle, Princess Aurora awaits true love’s kiss to break the spell under which she sleeps—and here is the beautiful girl’s handsome love, Prince Phillip, about to bestow the spell-breaking kiss that will awaken Aurora and restore the beloved princess to her kingdom. Lovingly crafted by famed folk artist Jim Shore, this romantic piece authentically captures the stylized elegance of Walt Disney’s animated classic Sleeping Beauty (1959). Aurora’s luxurious bedclothes are adorned with folk-art inspired patterns. With the look of handcrafted carving, this enchanting work—depicting the most unforgettable moment of this magnificent animated fairy tale—is splendidly detailed, from the heraldic atmosphere of the tower chamber to the rich folds of Phillip’s cape, under which his hunting boots are visible as he kneels before his love, to the rose clasped in the sleeping beauty’s delicate hands. The lovely princess and noble prince are irresistibly posed in front of an oversized storybook, complete with the official logo of the film emblazoned on the front cover, which serves as the back of this intricate piece. The open pages blend into an atmospheric backdrop from the animated film—the castle window with the night sky and landscape beyond—giving the entrancing feeing that you can step directly into the pages and become part of the story. Even the pages of book on the sides of this hand-painted sculpt are embellished with country-style designs. This lovingly crafted piece makes a truly novel way to remember the magic and romance of Sleeping Beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/919d8ZrQxqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B00L5QKJVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L5QKJVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L5QKJVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
