window.products.push({"id":833774,"name":"FunisFun Stainless Steel Food Containers with Lids Set of 3 Leakproof Salad Dressing Container to Go Food Storage Containers with Silicone Lids Lunch ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o3jUp0kQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM STAINLESS STEEL CONTAINERS. Our lunch box containers are made of 304 stainless steel with food-grade silicone which ensures their long-term use. The durable stainless steel snack containers are safe for the dishwasher, freezer and fridge. LEAK PROOF LUNCH CONTAINERS FOR ADULTS & KIDS. Do your old lunch box containers or stainless steel bento leak and stain in you bag or backpack? Don’t worry! Our stainless steel bento box can solve this problem for you. With excellent sealing mechanism, stainless steel food containers with lids are 100% leak proof and watertight. EASY TO OPEN & CLOSE. The edge of silicone lid is specially designed so your kids will have no problem removing and closing the silicone lid themselves. These portable, lightweight and reusable lunch boxes are perfect for school, daycare, picnic, summer camp, and travel. STORAGE CONTAINERS FOR MANY OCCASIONS. Stainless steel food containers of 3 size (13.5 oz, 7.4 oz, 3.7 oz) can meet your various daily needs. Perfect for dips, jam, salad dressing, sauces, lunch, snacks, leftovers, soup, sandwich and more! Also you can take it anywhere like office, gym, school, picnics etc. Whatever your food storage needs, our containers have you covered! MONEY- & SPACE-SAVING FOOD STORAGE CONTAINERS. The stainless steel storage containers are a must-have for kids and adults. The food containers are easy to clean and you can reuse it for a long time which can save lots of money. Also the stainless steel food bento set is stackable. When you don’t use them, you can put the small and medium lunch containers in the Large one. The steel storage containers with nesting design are a perfect way to save space!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o3jUp0kQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FunisFun","source_asin":"B09W9K8R5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W9K8R5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W9K8R5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
