window.products.push({"id":833853,"name":"Gezen Industrial Pipe Shelving 31.5in Floating Bookshelf,Wall Mounted Shelves Rustic Floating Shelves, Wall Storage Book Shelves for Living Room, Bedr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D5QyLHuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Industrial Floating Shelves]--The wall shelf is perfect for an industrial aesthetic. It features a pipe frame and a dark brown finish that can be easily combined with a variety of color schemes. Rustic and industrial elements meet on this floating wall shelves with clean lines to add a vintage feel to your room. [Super Stable and Durable]--The wall-mounted design enhances the stability and solidity of the industrial pipe shelf, provide strong support for the wooden board. The surface of the iron shelf is powder coated to prevent rust, it will last for years. It is an ideal storage shelf for living rooms, bedrooms, bathrooms and other places. [Rustic Brown Board]--The 2 tiers of the industrial shelves are made of P2 grade particle board (not solid wood) with a natural tree grain surface that is waterproof and scratch resistant. The lowest tier can hold 44 lbs. and the other tiers can hold 22 lbs. [Space Saving]--The 2-tier wall shelf is perfect for displaying potted plants, framed family photos, tableware and other items. The rustic shelf will not take up much space in your home. Instead, it can be mounted on the wall in the kitchen and above the toilet for item storage, which maximizes the use of space. [Dimensions & Tips]--31.5\"(L) x 11.8\"(W) x 23.6\"(H).Easy to assemble, according to the instructions, can be completed within 30 minutes. Installation advice: please draw a horizontal line on the wall first, then find the location of the screws on the wall and drill screw holes in the wall. Finally, use the screws to fix the shelf on the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71D5QyLHuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gezen","source_asin":"B096Q5GHX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096Q5GHX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096Q5GHX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
