window.products.push({"id":833955,"name":"NIBESSER Christmas Tree Collar White 30 Inches Ivory Tree Skirt Ring with Snowflake Tree Basket Plastics Sheets with Collar Cover Holiday Home Party C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vYgy6hnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄️ Premium Christmas Tree Collar: 【👀NOTED: This tree collar features gold snowflakes on the front and the back is pure white】Exquisite gift boxes for packaging to ensure that the goods you receive are intact. The package includes six pieces of sturdy sheets and a double-layer shiny collar. The collar is thick, durable, and not easy to deform. Pure white tree collar cover with big and small snowflake, simple and elegant design, create a cute and lovely atmosphere for this Christmas. ❄️ A great alternative to traditional Tree Skirts: Keeps your dog or other pets away from your Christmas tree base. Stops pets from drinking water from the base or chewing on the tree. Prevents fur, hair, and dander from getting onto the tree. Cover the unsightly tree base, make it look neater. Easy to clean and will not wrinkle like the normal tree skirt. 🎄 Suitable for MOST Christmas Trees: 24 inches (top) diam. x 30.3 inches (bottom) diam. x 10.6 H inch. Fits around most standard-size Christmas tree stands. Note: We suggest that you measure your tree stand to ensure its fit within the collar. 👍 Easy to Assemble: Connect plastics sheets together easily at the joint, then dress up the sequins collar. It can be finished by one person within 5 minutes. It is also easy to disassemble, convenient to store after Christmas. Six plastic sheets form a ring structure, which makes the tree skirt not easy to collapse and is very firm. 🎄 Christmas Tree Decorations: This brilliant tree collar adds a festive touch to your home. Create a classic and lovely look for your Christmas tree, the tree ring gives a graceful and rustic farmhouse charm to your holiday decorations. NIBESSER also offers other Christmas decors such as Christmas stockings, Christmas chair covers, and Christmas pet beds. Please take a look at our store if you have any other holiday needs or home decoration needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vYgy6hnYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIBESSER","source_asin":"B09FLDMM6R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-833955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLDMM6R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLDMM6R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
